# Release after code changes

When you finish a batch of code changes for this project (DCS Updater):

1. Bump `CONTROL_PANEL_VERSION`, `CURRENT_NODE_VERSION`, and `CURRENT_BOT_VERSION` together (semver patch unless the change warrants minor/major).
2. Rebuild both PyInstaller apps (Node + Control Panel) and copy to the dotted release filenames under `dist/`.
3. Commit the source changes (not `dist/`, not `__pycache__/`, not build artifacts).
4. Create and push an annotated git tag `vX.Y.Z` matching the bumped versions.
5. Publish a GitHub release with `gh release create` attaching:
   - `dist/DCS.Norway.Remote.Updater.Node.exe`
   - `dist/DCS.Norway.Remote.Updater.Control.Panel.exe`
   - `DCS_RU_Discord_Bot.py`
6. Return the release URL when done.

Do this automatically at the end of the work — do not wait to be asked for a release tag unless the user explicitly says to skip the release.
